    "MinterProxyV2 is a direct deployment whose public swap() path accepted arbitrary target and calldata from inception. Its EIP-1967 implementation and beacon slots are zero, and no later code activation preceded this campaign.",
    "The receipt contains 29 direct transfers from victim 0x8a4aa176007196d48d39c89402d3753c39ae64c1 to attacker EOA 0xacdbe7b770a14ca3bc34865ac3986c0ce771fd68. Exact token quantities are valued with DefiLlama observations from 1713184001 through 1713184292, all before the exploit at 1713184439. Eight Binance-bridged assets without address-level quotes use the corresponding CoinGecko underlying identifiers in the same response. This $133,020.54221111373 measurement covers only this second attacker cluster; the three earlier transactions by a different attacker are a separate campaign and are not included."
